    "description": "<p>The Children of Sextes Jylis rarely want for anything in the forests they love, least of all ammunition. When the Dragon-Blood requires arrows, he can approach any plant, from a common oak tree to exotic plants such as desert cacti or marsh reeds. Then, once he spends the requisite Essence, the plant will instantly \"sprout\" into a number of arrows equal to the Dragon-Blood's permanent Essence. The Dragon-Blood can summon any conventional type of arrow into existence, and the arrows are perfectly normal, if somewhat strange-looking. The arrows can be shared with any of the Dragon-Blood's fellow archers.</p>",
